{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look at Me\u201d is a first-person horror game in which the player is chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Playtime : 60 min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solo developed by S.P Dream of Guinea Pigs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player finds themselves in the middle of a creepy hallway, being chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=180 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A clown is chasing you\u2014but if you try to stare at it, it freezes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=276 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hallway is often dark. Press the F key to use your flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=354 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while performing other tasks (like entering a password or pushing a button), the clown can interrupt you. This means you need to complete tasks quickly or strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2966380?t=1763659062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/c726106441e667c7afb2eec0c62c146863b67350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763659062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/7f73b34c9a87b080c536afb7a938a27636ccad76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763659062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/7f73b34c9a87b080c536afb7a938a27636ccad76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763659062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Caution: This game includes\r\n\r\n-The gore scene \r\n-representation of corpse( cutted parts of body,)"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look at Me\u201d is a first-person horror game in which the player is chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Playtime : 60 min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solo developed by S.P Dream of Guinea Pigs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player finds themselves in the middle of a creepy hallway, being chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=180 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A clown is chasing you\u2014but if you try to stare at it, it freezes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=276 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hallway is often dark. Press the F key to use your flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=354 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while performing other tasks (like entering a password or pushing a button), the clown can interrupt you. This means you need to complete tasks quickly or strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dream of Guinea Pigs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/8f328c03d63c41b304ce5e89ed87f361a77b1e4a/header.jpg?t=1763659062","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2966380/980945571/2db8f46dd640f69834462fb45f9cef38b2a86111/1755982056/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758578586","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2966380/980945571/2db8f46dd640f69834462fb45f9cef38b2a86111/1755982056/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758578586","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2966380/980945571/2db8f46dd640f69834462fb45f9cef38b2a86111/1755982056/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758578586","id":257186505,"name":"Satoshi Perren","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/